0MTQyZGQ1ZmZlMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mlrun/ui/commit/140caf009ddaf8ab4b417cae0e0190b53f0798a3","sha":"140caf009ddaf8ab4b417cae0e0190b53f0798a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlrun/ui/commits/140caf009ddaf8ab4b417cae0e0190b53f0798a3"}],"sha":"504e43fd3c90a903c2f26668f20a4142dd5ffe21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlrun/ui/commits/504e43fd3c90a903c2f26668f20a4142dd5ffe21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155433425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi","id":155433425,"login":"Taras-Hlukhovetskyi","node_id":"U_kgDOCUO50Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Taras-Hlukhovetskyi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlrun/ui/commits/140caf009ddaf8ab4b417cae0e0190b53f0798a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:57:06Z","email":"155433425+Taras-Hlukhovetskyi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Taras-Hlukhovetskyi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T09:57:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #3754 from arturrybalskyy-dev/fix/npm-audit-safe-overrides\n\n[FIX] [Security] Bump vulnerable dependencies via npm overrides\n## 📝 Description\n\nCloses the majority of open Dependabot / `npm audit` alerts by pinning patched versions of vulnerable transitive dependencies through the `overrides` field in `package.json`. Only non-breaking fixes were applied.\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Changes Made\n\n| Package | Change | Severity |\n|---|---|---|\n| `brace-expansion` | 5.0.8 → 5.0.9 | high — DoS via unbounded intermediate arrays |\n| `fast-uri` | 3.1.4 → 3.1.5 | high — host confusion via backslash authority |\n| `ip-address` | 10.2.0 → 10.5.0 | high — SSRF / trust-boundary bypass (×3) |\n| `js-yaml` | 4.3.0 → 4.3.1 | high — quadratic CPU in `!!omap` |\n| `js-yaml` (under `@istanbuljs/load-nyc-config`) | 3.15.0 → 3.15.1 | high — same |\n| `nanoid` | 3.3.16 → 3.3.18 | high — infinite loop on zero size |\n| `dompurify` (via `monaco-editor`) | 3.4.12 → 3.4.14 | moderate — XSS via `IN_PLACE` hook removal |\n| `postcss` | 8.5.22 → 8.5.26 | moderate — arbitrary `.map` read; also clears the whole `stylelint` / `autoprefixer` chain (13 alerts) |\n| `react-router-dom` / `react-router` | 6.30.4 → 6.30.6 | moderate — open redirect via backslash (CVE-2026-53669) |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Checklist\n\n- [x] I have given the PR a well-structured title describing the domain and the specific change that was made\n- [ ] I tested the changes in the browser (locally or via preview build)\n- [x] I confirmed that existing tests pass — `vitest run`: 30/30 files, 471/471 tests\n- [ ] I added or updated unit / integration tests (if needed) — n/a, dependency-only change\n- [x] I checked that this change doesn''t introduce new console warnings or lint / formatting errors — `npm run lint` clean, `npm run build` succeeds\n- [ ] I updated the relevant Jira ticket with the appropriate details and status\n\n---\n\n## 🚨 Potentially Breaking Changes\n\n- [ ] Yes\n- [x] No\n\n---\n\n## Includes DRC change\n\n- [ ] Yes\n- [x] No","tree":{"sha":"1a93cb742f84e123b162ee467a398db77b93bf74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlrun/ui/git/trees/1a93cb742f84e123b162ee467a398db77b93bf74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mlrun/ui/git/commits/140caf009ddaf8ab4b417cae0e0190b53f0798a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a93cb742f84e123b162ee467a398db77b93bf74\nparent c4235698cba093958c02281cd20dbe0ab380230e\nparent e19b66510cfe2e53b1a01e85f8628f9afb2c0b6c\nauthor Taras-Hlukhovetskyi <155433425+Taras-Hlukhovetskyi@users.noreply.github.com> 1788429426 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788429426 +0300\n\nMerge pull request #3754 from arturrybalskyy-dev/fix/npm-audit-safe-overrides\n\n[FIX] [Security] Bump vulnerable dependencies via npm overrides\n## 📝 Description\n\nCloses the majority of open Dependabot / `npm audit` alerts by pinning patched versions of vulnerable transitive dependencies through the `overrides` field in `package.json`. Only non-breaking fixes were applied.\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Changes Made\n\n| Package | Change | Severity |\n|---|---|---|\n| `brace-expansion` | 5.0.8 → 5.0.9 | high — DoS via unbounded intermediate arrays |\n| `fast-uri` | 3.1.4 → 3.1.5 | high — host confusion via backslash authority |\n| `ip-address` | 10.2.0 → 10.5.0 | high — SSRF / trust-boundary bypass (×3) |\n| `js-yaml` | 4.3.0 → 4.3.1 | high — quadratic CPU in `!!omap` |\n| `js-yaml` (under `@istanbuljs/load-nyc-config`) | 3.15.0 → 3.15.1 | high — same |\n| `nanoid` | 3.3.16 → 3.3.18 | high — infinite loop on zero size |\n| `dompurify` (via `monaco-editor`) | 3.4.12 → 3.4.14 | moderate — XSS via `IN_PLACE` hook removal |\n| `postcss` | 8.5.22 → 8.5.26 | moderate — arbitrary `.map` read; also clears the whole `stylelint` / `autoprefixer` chain (13 alerts) |\n| `react-router-dom` / `react-router` | 6.30.4 → 6.30.6 | moderate — open redirect via backslash (CVE-2026-53669) |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Checklist\n\n- [x] I have given the PR a well-structured title describing the domain and the specific change that was made\n- [ ] I tested the changes in the browser (locally or via preview build)\n- [x] I confirmed that existing tests pass — `vitest run`: 30/30 files, 471/471 tests\n- [ ] I added or updated unit / integration tests (if needed) — n/a, dependency-only change\n- [x] I checked that this change doesn''t introduce new console warnings or lint / formatting errors — `npm run lint` clean, `npm run build` succeeds\n- [ ] I updated the relevant Jira ticket with the appropriate details and status\n\n---\n\n## 🚨 Potentially Breaking Changes\n\n- [ ] Yes\n- [x] No\n\n---\n\n## Includes DRC change\n\n- [ ] Yes\n- [x] No","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmURyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6NsQAA4g0LVqijhMsBvk3TQJBCB8\n47g9hdAyXsGipthAQAza5Qb6IN5ZmWuw8uBrNZjHX9zIXlXWpJu814JzU9vaE+fh\nRIwZZ7zT748pc44jJ3EgJDIIZ6CtkT7A4dWFzZ5CCel43g8Da0dEv4JpdHZC8FNB\nCvoY1SNd6yJs2QoNWCf+VCwyDIwF56ZwP7XzScGc6gk0TNzyzuXqTjUx07ubrcWu\nO9UhPDV72rbe8qpWdr180ufxSl1d5qxpo33eZj1k1HldCD9rWto08d1FUGzh17Qn\nVpqkF2NJUzr2tuTHn0cH7kuW3zulTrjhOSEHSW29aoL1udTuFQPWsrFVrUeTPKY8\np2QNdvL7Ups03KZSeFnDNnYzTsNS7CJEn4tW2piXSXO9gBrJT11m7X9VdndIMl84\nJgnRdpH1aX3R/aNg3Jlnmop33dYBg8fXFJtnQiA3JGxpqeqLufqdgRJDuFLb4hSk\nRqkvPyJTSzuNp/IQ+4Lud5WZWJ6E9IkElCvCtXlJneUvOJyy/i3r1JW8NvGaYiLu\nbo3gYrFPCEKkSY6CSV5vB0PXEO2AJwPj5dC0YD+FcbwuC49rbyXbnCzlT6w39qej\neMo4OkNAK+PJbNdKGGKdc7CIURzdz7gEVopjhO2ELkCD72FfuqIFxrK0IlWA/Cmu\nnm6ytHOaM3XnfLPYAgcl\n=oZMy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T09:57:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use