son repository.url to match the OIDC-asserted source\nrepository. @tonic-ui/mcp had no repository field, so npm rejected the\npublish of 3.0.0-alpha.1 with:\n\n  E422 Error verifying sigstore provenance bundle: Failed to validate\n  repository information: package.json: \"repository.url\" is \"\", expected\n  to match \"https://github.com/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui\" from provenance\n\nAdd the same repository block the other publishable packages already have.","tree":{"sha":"d5d9721495f5477391cef168d409e10e96bf54d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/d5d9721495f5477391cef168d409e10e96bf54d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/4ae7bb896f697b48a877c5e788dd05f58a009a39","verification":{"payload":"tree d5d9721495f5477391cef168d409e10e96bf54d0\nparent 4fceaa868b26844f1372e1eb83436e20686028c8\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1789833917 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789833917 +0800\n\nfix(mcp): add repository field to fix npm provenance validation failure (#1208)\n\nfix(mcp): add repository field for npm provenance validation\n\nThe release workflow publishes with NPM_CONFIG_PROVENANCE=true, which\nrequires package.json repository.url to match the OIDC-asserted source\nrepository. @tonic-ui/mcp had no repository field, so npm rejected the\npublish of 3.0.0-alpha.1 with:\n\n  E422 Error verifying sigstore provenance bundle: Failed to validate\n  repository information: package.json: \"repository.url\" is \"\", expected\n  to match \"https://github.com/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui\" from provenance\n\nAdd the same repository block the other publishable packages already have.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrrK9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYgsQAHtS9QEPsd6FVARuOqoIgQhW\n7gNVrFHQjEbN1Kb8SKYncagtApWNUR1AJ3xe/aLphuMLyIGixRzRNUUzNOkjqVTN\nrS0w1HYeL/So4EYxPl1+447cs9Q4tmnzfIcRHCYt6lyIz+dTlLm/dfyZlx6LzR+j\njm72PnVsi/0ZyxyXpW