ndmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/5f770984d8f2ac675bb8f0e6cb6467e772a43772"}],"sha":"14b8199184b6bcdea69f895348d27d6836493d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/14b8199184b6bcdea69f895348d27d6836493d1b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/447801?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheton","id":447801,"login":"cheton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzgwMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/5f770984d8f2ac675bb8f0e6cb6467e772a43772/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T01:46:17Z","email":"447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Cheton Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T01:46:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(react): add Dropdown, DropdownButton, DropdownChip, and DropdownToggle components (#1206)\n\n* feat(react): add Dropdown, DropdownButton, DropdownChip, and DropdownToggle components\n\n- Dropdown renders selectable items from `items` via the internal Menu engine, with controlled/uncontrolled value, groups, dividers, and submenus\n- Toggle wiring uses prop injection (`renderToggle` receiving `getToggleProps`), so any element can act as a dropdown toggle without a dedicated wrapper\n- `DropdownButton` wraps `MenuButton` with dropdown variants; `DropdownChip` composes a `Tag` pill as a chip-style toggle with an overlay close button\n- `MenuToggle` render-prop context now exposes `getToggleProps` (alias of `getMenuToggleProps`) accepting user props: `disabled` is OR-merged, handlers chain before the internal ones and honor `preventDefault`, other keys spread first so menu wiring wins\n- `Autocomplete` formalizes `slots.root`/`slots.content` and `AutocompleteList` migrates to `slots.popper`/`slots.transition` with deprecation warnings for the legacy props\n- `Tag` focus-visible outline adopts the shared keyboard focus token (`_component.keyboardFocused.outerFocusRing`)\n- JSDoc typedefs added across content/slot components (accordion, drawer, input, menu, modal, popover, tooltip, tree)\n- Docs: new Dropdown page with button-toggle, chip, search, slot-props, and playground examples; removes the dropdown/search-dropdown experiment pages\n\n* chore: rename changesets to reference PR #1206","tree":{"sha":"f207e0cd008be3221666893676b8b959cf20ed74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/f207e0cd008be3221666893676b8b959cf20ed74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/5f770984d8f2ac675bb8f0e6cb6467e772a43772","verification":{"payload":"tree f207e0cd008be3221666893676b8b959cf20ed74\nparent cd715671457be4325e34649f02c84bd47d90d9f8\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1789695977 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789695977 +0800\n\nfeat(react): add Dropdown, DropdownButton, DropdownChip, and DropdownToggle components (#1206)\n\n* feat(react): add Dropdown, DropdownButton, DropdownChip, and DropdownToggle components\n\n- Dropdown renders selectable items from `items` via the internal Menu engine, with controlled/uncontrolled value, groups, dividers, and submenus\n- Toggle wiring uses prop injection (`renderToggle` receiving `getToggleProps`), so any element can act as a dropdown toggle without a dedicated wrapper\n- `DropdownButton` wraps `MenuButton` with dropdown variants; `DropdownChip` composes a `Tag` pill as a chip-style toggle with an overlay close button\n- `MenuToggle` render-prop context now exposes `getToggleProps` (alias of `getMenuToggleProps`) accepting user props: `disabled` is OR-merged, handlers chain before the internal ones and honor `preventDefault`, other keys spread first so menu wiring wins\n- `Autocomplete` formalizes `slots.root`/`slots.content` and `AutocompleteList` migrates to `slots.popper`/`slots.transition` with deprecation warnings for the legacy props\n- `Tag` focus-visible outline adopts the shared keyboard focus token (`_component.keyboardFocused.outerFocusRing`)\n- JSDoc typedefs added across content/slot components (accordion, drawer, input, menu, modal, popover, tooltip, tree)\n- Docs: new Dropdown page with button-toggle, chip, search, slot-props, and playground examples; removes the dropdown/search-dropdown experiment pages\n\n* chore: rename changesets to reference PR #1206","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrJfpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA250QAJkhnOaN9ziAjKxyWGaG4kkV\n6gHECHY+3/1ZABGV8qOuisraVs2EAHpi5kEvj65elNbL17yeqXUYjmHg/4RiyvMz\ntqliPwtHeOaWeY4lPTerF/X+V/yLd5TJMsX6FaFXq+bU5y6wrQESjYafBGE2tFSL\nqD9EfM0PdU04cZtnOqDArui1EjxcUO27WC/+46pUxDZ5OArmhwXUCZY6gSjK9fNr\nuV1R6FoywLu6k/DQ/vWdVGrfqYfNgJ5S9uOjeF7KQUzG9E1GaelbXkIMcqHSYRbC\nw/xGVmn1PZ72L9M4SgZ8IEP+HJ0w/qBns8gbfBD5CGAs9xSXvDVXY7QqjI/isgWM\nEJNbEWEvVkIBCuyGt3VwiPda02bipLR+faF3lq/iZXAIM3EDrAckA0/g3WjA7BsK\nAJcC95kW0OLsUWWl1aeJVDFeuApKWr5wJZSJ3oW7L2NL+4Zb4Uet4gKZaOVw1WbW\nw+xMYyjZFnVFPPxs2JRKnSLDND4WLnwm88RMocUrY+AFYAq40TMET1v2Jozn/Ojg\nPhuttXbe2I9qzhLH5Jbq/5o2jssBxgECSh1OUzeksF/hK/VkEZw0Cnv9MZfAjYWw\nX8IGHKn9Yt+vMB1B8bqYp8E18BxHMSuoKFf1Gy2jeU0MjZiW4Qqn5Qk5Qqn8DuPP\nMfLGh46YEE5WpQPDvHzv\n=TNCB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T01:46