ning: no\nmore GH_TOKEN exposure window during yarn add, no more workflow-level\nissues: write, no more scripts/github-issue-comment-cli in the\ntrusted-tooling checkout.\n\nscripts/pr-preview/post-comment.js and its test are now dead code (no\nother caller) and removed. scripts/github-issue-comment-cli/ stays --\nci-pr.yml still uses it for an unrelated docs-deploy comment.","tree":{"sha":"8616917953c27c8f0fabaf24a9ef53201c4d17d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/8616917953c27c8f0fabaf24a9ef53201c4d17d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/cc01d68c9a71db5fec7a725aea7e90e1e0061e41","verification":{"payload":"tree 8616917953c27c8f0fabaf24a9ef53201c4d17d4\nparent 79e59835bb1718291fceb6eba6a490baa49015d2\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1785567621 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785567621 +0800\n\nfix(ci): drop PR comment posting from ci-pr-preview (#1187)\n\nPreview publishing doesn''t need to post install instructions as a PR\ncomment -- consumers can find the published preview branch directly.\nDropping it removes the entire attack surface #1186 was hardening: no\nmore GH_TOKEN exposure window during yarn add, no more workflow-level\nissues: write, no more scripts/github-issue-comment-cli in the\ntrusted-tooling checkout.\n\nscripts/pr-preview/post-comment.js and its test are now dead code (no\nother caller) and removed. scripts/github-issue-comment-cli/ stays --\nci-pr.yml still uses it for an unrelated docs-deploy comment.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbZmFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABC8QAGH80CJoEe0z7Iumc4AXYppw\n34kMcqeuMokP1ewIJq00Sgd757qiY2ISs1ez3Vj/jg5gsZTjdTcbgxY49k0bpU6V\n++pbksyd+naIAVOTX3asGQCBJsjY9zzvf/maHvWWZNMddBe4tNIxkM03bat4qD6x\nypAJk+40imzdrVj50i1feQshv05SbTeCY6R1Fo3p8QLhCrq5lM8NrgWyWLtHIqlK\nRlSmlDgdSk8lk9N8IrkcW3aNzQMbbZeaICtuUc9qziNBwl0LvBK6R32282vfk+sl\nlmvG+92L2hsDbRsV+n6zXTsTIcBSdkGvt