thub.com/users/cheton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheton","id":447801,"login":"cheton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzgwMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/0386eefe6b6576701846c66dca9bc98fb84ae742/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T15:14:57Z","email":"447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Cheton Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T15:14:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: v2-to-v3 doc cleanup, stale CI config removal, and Yarn 4 upgrade (#1174)\n\n* chore: update v2 references to v3 in docs and MCP config\n\nUpdate codecov badge branch, doc links, MCP config example version,\nllms.txt header, and mcp package version to reflect the v3 release.\n\n* chore: update v2 references to v3 in docs and lerna config\n\nRemove the deprecated v0 docs link, switch lerna''s allowed release\nbranch from v2 to main, and point the MCP llms.txt version at v3.\n\n* chore: remove unused examples dir and clean up stale CI config\n\nThe `examples/react-template` dir isn''t in the yarn workspaces, isn''t\nreferenced by any CI workflow, and the only remaining pointer to it\n(.codesandbox/ci.json''s sandboxes path) already targeted a different,\nnonexistent path. Remove the dir and empty the sandboxes list.\n\nAlso update update-yarn-lock-file.sh''s MAIN_BRANCH from master to main\nto match the repo''s current default branch.\n\n* chore: empty stale sandboxes list and fix main branch references\n\nThe earlier examples/ removal commit didn''t actually pick up these\nedits (a failed `git add` pathspec aborted before staging them):\nempty .codesandbox/ci.json''s sandboxes list now that examples/ is\ngone, point update-yarn-lock-file.sh at the main branch instead of\nmaster, and drop the hardcoded v2.0.1 example in the publishing docs.\n\n* chore: upgrade Yarn from 3.2.4 to 4.17.1\n\nRan `yarn set version stable`, which migrated the project to Yarn 4\nand rewrote yarn.lock to the v10 lockfile format (checksums re-hashed,\ndependency ranges made explicit with the npm: protocol — no actual\nresolution changes). nodeLinker stays node-modules; no plugins or\nconstraints were in use, so no further migration was needed.\n\nVerified by running the test suites for @tonic-ui/utils and\n@tonic-ui/react (821 tests) after reinstalling — all pass.\n\nNew defaults added by the migration to .yarnrc.yml preserve prior\nbehavior: approvedGitRepositories wildcarded and npmMinimalAgeGate set\nto 0 (both new v4 supply-chain safeguards, off by default).","tree":{"sha":"05b0cd56d7dbcb68f37e2823470248e548e389fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/05b0cd56d7dbcb68f37e2823470248e548e389fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/0386eefe6b6576701846c66dca9bc98fb84ae742","verification":{"payload":"tree 05b0cd56d7dbcb68f37e2823470248e548e389fb\nparent b9fd26cf7a3cfb577c4f81b72b17daa29ae83c42\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1784387697 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784387697 +0800\n\nchore: v2-to-v3 doc cleanup, stale CI config removal, and Yarn 4 upgrade (#1174)\n\n* chore: update v2 references to v3 in docs and MCP config\n\nUpdate codecov badge branch, doc links, MCP config example version,\nllms.txt header, and mcp package version to reflect the v3 release.\n\n* chore: update v2 references to v3 in docs and lerna config\n\nRemove the deprecated v0 docs link, switch lerna''s allowed release\nbranch from v2 to main, and point the MCP llms.txt version at v3.\n\n* chore: remove unused examples dir and clean up stale CI config\n\nThe `examples/react-template` dir isn''t in the yarn workspaces, isn''t\nreferenced by any CI workflow, and the only remaining pointer to it\n(.codesandbox/ci.json''s sandboxes path) already targeted a different,\nnonexistent path. Remove the dir and empty the sandboxes list.\n\nAlso update update-yarn-lock-file.sh''s MAIN_BRANCH from master to main\nto match the repo''s current default branch.\n\n* chore: empty stale sandboxes list and fix main branch references\n\nThe earlier examples/ removal commit didn''t actually pick up these\nedits (a failed `git add` pathspec aborted before staging them):\nempty .codesandbox/ci.json''s sandboxes list now that examples/ is\ngone, point update-yarn-lock-file.sh at the main branch instead of\nmaster, and drop the hardcoded v2.0.1 example in the publishing docs.\n\n* chore: upgrade Yarn from 3.2.4 to 4.17.1\n\nRan `yarn set version stable`, which migrated the project to Yarn 4\nand rewrote yarn.lock to the v10 lockfile format (checksums re-hashed,\ndependency ranges made explicit with the npm: protocol — no actual\nresolution changes). nodeLinker stays node-modules; no plugins or\nconstraints were in use, so no further migration was needed.\n\nVerified by running the test suites for @tonic-ui/utils and\n@tonic-ui/react (821 tests) after reinstalling — all pass.\n\nNew defaults added by the migration to .yarnrc.yml preserve prior\nbehavior: approvedGitRepositories wildcarded and npmMinimalAgeGate set\nto 0 (both new v4 supply-chain safeguards, off by default).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW5hxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASU4QAEZcATyLBRzdf4mgbPbkWtM6\noRhNMif+RFwHtWQO+unr2NzhSMkIoSkpqSt4P3d6j4jT8Ij1V2RfvWJUZ7F9AHEQ\nCOo4JGK/rTpa4vDsiEbBOyGjA39n0PXgQ7yUn+zFbM5ZBZKwBN/E+2w7DB88ctmg\nkzg9QiaimSJm3YGiJH5vEltMtsD8bol2JqWXBNUwyebjLBga4ms/aOT