447801,"login":"cheton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzgwMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/d0052ee407132fb88c72701f2742a6d5fb5795b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T08:02:15Z","email":"447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Cheton Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T08:02:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(codemod): add `style-props-to-sx` codemod (#1171)\n\n* feat(codemod): add `style-props-to-sx` codemod\n\nAdds a jscodeshift codemod that converts flat Tonic One style props on\nJSX elements into the `sx` prop, with wrapper-resolution logic to avoid\ntouching components/props that aren''t safe to migrate automatically.\n\n* chore: remove ignored package `@tonic-ui/changelog-github` from changeset file\n\n* fix(ci): skip private react-docs package in CodeSandbox CI build\n\nreact-docs isn''t in the CI packages list and doesn''t need to build there.\nIts module-federation remote build was failing in the CI environment.\n\n* fix(sandbox): enforce PR-pinned versions for core Tonic UI packages\n\nCodeSandbox examples could resolve core packages to unrelated versions\nwhen they weren''t directly imported in the example content. Enforce\nthe PR commit build for react, react-base, react-hooks, react-icons,\nstyled-system, theme, and utils during PR builds.\n\nAlso bump codemod package version to 3.0.0-alpha.0 to match the v3\nprerelease.\n\n* docs: add required peer dependencies to installation guide","tree":{"sha":"1ab31460c293e28e29329e165ddc825f04bb54ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/1ab31460c293e28e29329e165ddc825f04bb54ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/d0052ee407132fb88c72701f2742a6d5fb5795b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ab31460c293e28e29329e165ddc825f04bb54ba\nparent 0f7c3ce9c5e8c096df80883592209d33a067c1b3\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1784361735 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784361735 +0800\n\nfeat(codemod): add `style-props-to-sx` codemod (#1171)\n\n* feat(codemod): add `style-props-to-sx` codemod\n\nAdds a jscodeshift codemod that converts flat Tonic One style props on\nJSX elements into the `sx` prop, with wrapper-resolution logic to avoid\ntouching components/props that aren''t safe to migrate automatically.\n\n* chore: remove ignored package `@tonic-ui/changelog-github` from changeset file\n\n* fix(ci): skip private react-docs package in CodeSandbox CI build\n\nreact-docs isn''t in the CI packages list and doesn''t need to build there.\nIts module-federation remote build was failing in the CI environment.\n\n* fix(sandbox): enforce PR-pinned versions for core Tonic UI packages\n\nCodeSandbox examples could resolve core packages to unrelated versions\nwhen they weren''t directly imported in the example content. Enforce\nthe PR commit build for react, react-base, react-hooks, react-icons,\nstyled-system, theme, and utils during PR builds.\n\nAlso bump codemod package version to 3.0.0-alpha.0 to match the v3\nprerelease.\n\n* docs: add required peer dependencies to installation guide","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWzMHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxBcQAAb9xwjWB45I96+CMtbVira9\nAAmTkIMcBJk9hqEESpnuXLerAw8NerVQlEUA/bCh1Ko03tq8CfUQtWok3uQDehVy\nqpBJoTuf3cXXmB6E6pvOWawc4qlcmDedRm0TjadY5qkw690jvxid+gCyf1cQvqZl\nvza6XLT93qCcul+nixqHLHxE32ZdjYUAfIfCvg8anjHpVPXBFHBid7v7Ry6lSl43\nrzH+t12M1mW9MNTymBQ