 default to undefined. The assertion was meant to catch\nauthors who forgot to merge a deprecated prop, but false-fires on new slots\nthat have no legacy counterpart.\n\n- Drop the `slotProps === undefined` assertion; keep the `slot` element-type\n  assertion and fold the slot name into its message: `slots.<name>` / `slot element`.\n- Rename the internal `ownerDisplayName` option to `ownerName` across\n  useSlot, all call sites, tests, and docs.\n- Add useSlot unit tests and an InputControl regression test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove migrate-useslot-fix loop state\n\nLoop complete — all units done, 22 tests passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Create tonic-ui-pr-1162.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31b42bd2842d75a10b443cc689df24fc4c028e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/31b42bd2842d75a10b443cc689df24fc4c028e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/522738e5ba835756c202a4e19ba3146caaca32d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 31b42bd2842d75a10b443cc689df24fc4c028e0f\nparent c55082ebe85144207da7317e3641105c3c43ac44\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1781586557 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781586557 +0800\n\nfix(react): remove false-positive useSlot slotProps warning (#1162)\n\n* fix(react): remove false-positive useSlot slotProps warning\n\nPort of tonic-one a093754e6. `useSlot` emitted `slots.<name> is required\nbut was not provided` whenever a component rendered without customizing a\nslot whose slotProps default to undefined. The assertion was meant to catch\nauthors who forgot to merge a deprecated prop, but false-fires on new slots\nthat have no legacy counterpart.\n\n- Drop the `slotProps === undefined` assertion; keep the `slot` element-type\n  assertion and fold the slot name into its message: `slots.<name>` / `slot element`.\n- Rename the internal `ownerDisplayName` option to `ownerName` across\n  useSlot, all call sites, tests, and docs.\n- Add useSlot unit tests and an InputControl regression test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove migrate-useslot-fix loop state\n\nLoop complete — all units done, 22 tests passing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Create tonic-ui-pr-1162.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMNp9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwBAQAFxEaXvN3h+rUiByqVYkdbYo\npGHCkVA8z4SNzIUk7dW1Ff9C0Dkgf/Y9BfRPzcfTLFuwE+xxMjXTY3N0fwFKXFyz\nZQ+GDFWAcnBK3//c5ccl/qNz/kaPCFmktllujU1oJd45gk2PTQA5d1kRQXoN3+he\nXHP8Hw+HfbYsWJFMV98eLx2taKnBWJqmF1pf9vP+R5pvjUV+uG78iRJtHMqMJyJ4\nciazzz1XPaTg47xTekUrch/fRj1ZTjibQtw5Dr09WI6UiGUDoLyTVrWBUv7ey2TK\nQ/iTjDhab8EEseGRD2csy6ScZ+dw3CcqKcKjRStojgNr8D2FBcNsl1p/cNW5Iysv\nri+bg+IvLekILDf7VaG/DxK+0WHqQE2G/I+bZ+prpRASTIJLjVtWuko9SXk7nPKQ\n7HGA2ImbuuVsyqvZi9JYtrKqm7OKV9nt65G8FhNtrorF17PwH0Nr+0GeJ7ZK/GH6\nXQ+VN9FNx2LIir6rKv+2uBFMDWA5L6JE2ATpvAXZPggdsoMbq5WrAvJ/b1cQe1+1\nhpJvUtscgGxjn/TqBU9S5GmvD/D80q7uv1d2yDI4xBSYQP35GpF93b648nGtcZ/Q\nZAahPnVsRG/zbR8NtHMwwI4sGhN6l3lWFjOLQUwnFovHQwONeNF9c6qLD7vxJyZf\nFaPCsIMrtls24aSPngOU\n=mFHb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-16T05:09:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VX