/api.github.com/users/cheton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/d7ae4862da29cba5f22ab9c1b9ee9e24ea745ad6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T05:56:43Z","email":"447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Cheton Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T05:56:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(react-docs/experiments): improve event handling and menu list sizing in `DropdownBase` (#1130)\n\n* feat(dropdown): improve event handling and menu list sizing in DropdownBase\n\n- Add defaultPrevented guards to click and keydown handlers\n- Chain item-level onClick/onKeyDown with internal handlers via callEventHandlers\n- Replace portalled/non-portalled branching with unified menuListStyle logic\n- Support fitToggleWidth slot prop for controlling menu width behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(dropdown-base): add slotProps.content and fitToggleWidth API documentation\n\nDocument the slotProps.content prop for passing props to the MenuList\ncomponent and the fitToggleWidth option for matching dropdown menu\nwidth to the toggle width.\n\n* docs(dropdown): add slotProps.content and fitToggleWidth to usage examples\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c3deaeeb7fddae3bd78f5eebe4d60236a7f3669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/0c3deaeeb7fddae3bd78f5eebe4d60236a7f3669"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/d7ae4862da29cba5f22ab9c1b9ee9e24ea745ad6","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c3deaeeb7fddae3bd78f5eebe4d60236a7f3669\nparent 22c3b485d90a67011af7e3229694a44b47f1a772\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1775282203 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775282203 +0800\n\nfeat(react-docs/experiments): improve event handling and menu list sizing in `DropdownBase` (#1130)\n\n* feat(dropdown): improve event handling and menu list sizing in DropdownBase\n\n- Add defaultPrevented guards to click and keydown handlers\n- Chain item-level onClick/onKeyDown with internal handlers via callEventHandlers\n- Replace portalled/non-portalled branching with unified menuListStyle logic\n- Support fitToggleWidth slot prop for controlling menu width behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(dropdown-base): add slotProps.content and fitToggleWidth API documentation\n\nDocument the slotProps.content prop for passing props to the MenuList\ncomponent and the fitToggleWidth option for matching dropdown menu\nwidth to the toggle width.\n\n* docs(dropdown): add slotProps.content and fitToggleWidth to usage examples\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp0KgbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABYgQAKaFHQtym/a4Sn/vFtPwF5lL\n7j9dB6mZASOwp+7QfBTqxk2nUmNPhtOMyTBIUJhz4D/4mxoCk/SPayo6MZRGwWT8\n5SnF5pP0hPJONgostEx41I/6DZnxydylJ8+mrHXsDz1hHBCKbyF2J0a+ANaSqDu8\ntSOcLB0JEOsgxG5Y7LuTKsSUKhKyaVIABltrFTbF7bR6IjIKUoU+BtGyggmqMvlb\nGK4nsOekVVww8rKdqwQuouKpeyw8rXiYIPuoTiYUU8Ruzvn7Oki+lP3u7j0jhGHd\n2NH/k8HYI40TmJhtifE26eeZj347jmkvzndTnjvLopFdWMM134G0rN+mPMcFXcHl\nAd/z6UpMixJdPmSKLX6NylMKwYrh3eWUxSiYsW1kKcea79Lm53FWSqii6v4Z0Xx6\nYpmzn+ydfrmHh2kU5p+Vx0cYbXphfhgemo8JWySMXwxiIxR7KjpaDVuajlkan7gS\nETG6q3ZKXubQlfeqxsVC7XieT1rYX7H1tVHGP5W5LaCkIx32LzkiXQz6GjTRHR43\ncJGI8cEx17avON0bFvnk0ivvr0cu8wFzwHCapAyUnlHMPCMtfEXwD9Phqk+TDyHQ\nLFKiE/mTNt8FmCuz6QeE4YRTcVqKRMAGT3yMhj0p3IT5RzOwG53u8eSmdYVCUsVN\nd/ve68nqpiyS1/M/mldO\n=rD4T\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-04T05:56:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http