ntent.com/u/447801?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheton","id":447801,"login":"cheton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzgwMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/d1ab6a037fccdb6950cfc0b671b4dcc2e97cd19e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T13:15:42Z","email":"447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Cheton Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T13:15:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(react): use fully rounded border-radius for Badge and Tag (#1125)\n\n* refactor(react): replace getMemoizedState with useShallowMemo hook\n\nIntroduce useShallowMemo, a per-instance memoization hook backed by\nmicro-memoize v5 with isKeyItemEqual: ''shallow'', replacing the\nmodule-level getMemoizedState pattern across 29 components. The old\napproach shared a single cache across all component instances (maxSize\n1), causing cross-instance cache eviction. The new hook creates an\nindependent memoized function per instance via useRef, ensuring stable\ncontext object references without requiring an explicit dependency array.\n\nAlso bumps micro-memoize from 4.x to 5.x and updates imports to the\nv5 named export. useShallowMemo is called immediately after\nuseDefaultProps in every component, matching the established pattern.\n\n* fix(react): fix lint errors from useShallowMemo refactor\n\n- Remove extra blank lines causing no-multiple-empty-lines errors\n- Use error_${index} key in FormErrorMessage to avoid react/no-array-index-key warning\n\n* chore: add changeset for PR #1120\n\n* refactor(react): move useShallowMemo to right after useDefaultProps in table components\n\n* feat(react): use fully rounded border-radius for Badge and Tag\n\n* chre: add `tonic-ui-pr-1125` changeset","tree":{"sha":"297c432883bc639edec44ea0c336c58ca6bb1cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/297c432883bc639edec44ea0c336c58ca6bb1cc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/d1ab6a037fccdb6950cfc0b671b4dcc2e97cd19e","verification":{"payload":"tree 297c432883bc639edec44ea0c336c58ca6bb1cc2\nparent 9b0b413c5bad2623ba1a62874a03fa126bc82864\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1774185342 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774185342 +0800\n\nfeat(react): use fully rounded border-radius for Badge and Tag (#1125)\n\n* refactor(react): replace getMemoizedState with useShallowMemo hook\n\nIntroduce useShallowMemo, a per-instance memoization hook backed by\nmicro-memoize v5 with isKeyItemEqual: ''shallow'', replacing the\nmodule-level getMemoizedState pattern across 29 components. The old\napproach shared a single cache across all component instances (maxSize\n1), causing cross-instance cache eviction. The new hook creates an\nindependent memoized function per instance via useRef, ensuring stable\ncontext object references without requiring an explicit dependency array.\n\nAlso bumps micro-memoize from 4.x to 5.x and updates imports to the\nv5 named export. useShallowMemo is called immediately after\nuseDefaultProps in every component, matching the established pattern.\n\n* fix(react): fix lint errors from useShallowMemo refactor\n\n- Remove 