om/cheton","id":447801,"login":"cheton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzgwMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/commits/51c99890bb709c3dc6fe42ee67623bf3cf46e99a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-24T15:51:35Z","email":"447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Cheton Wu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-24T15:51:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): upgrade @testing-library/react from v14 to v15 (#1112)\n\n* chore(deps): upgrade @testing-library/react from v14 to v15\n\nUpgrades @testing-library/react from ^14.0.0 to ^15.0.0 across\npackages/react, packages/react-base, and packages/react-hooks.\n\nv15 imports `act` from `react` directly instead of the deprecated\n`react-dom/test-utils`, eliminating the deprecation warning seen\nwhen running tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(menu): fix timing issues and update snapshot\n\n- Wrap `jest.advanceTimersByTime` in `act()` in Submenu.test.js to\n  properly flush React state updates triggered by fake timers\n- Add `waitFor` and `act` delay in Menu.test.js to wait for the\n  Collapse transition to complete before snapshotting\n- Update Menu snapshot to reflect the completed transition state\n  (`height: auto` instead of `height: 0; overflow: hidden`)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(menu): fix no-promise-executor-return lint errors in test files\n\nUse block body syntax for promise executor functions to avoid implicitly\nreturning values from setTimeout and requestAnimationFrame calls.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f958d2cfc010c862e4323fed066a23534e9ccddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/trees/f958d2cfc010c862e4323fed066a23534e9ccddf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trendmicro-frontend/tonic-ui/git/commits/51c99890bb709c3dc6fe42ee67623bf3cf46e99a","verification":{"payload":"tree f958d2cfc010c862e4323fed066a23534e9ccddf\nparent e868e8882d6f32e46165560b587e8d5d828d32f5\nauthor Cheton Wu <447801+cheton@users.noreply.github.com> 1771948295 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771948295 +0800\n\nchore(deps): upgrade @testing-library/react from v14 to v15 (#1112)\n\n* chore(deps): upgrade @testing-library/react from v14 to v15\n\nUpgrades @testing-library/react from ^14.0.0 to ^15.0.0 across\npackages/react, packages/react-base, and packages/react-hooks.\n\nv15 imports `act` from `react` directly instead of the deprecated\n`react-dom/test-utils`, eliminating the deprecation warning seen\nwhen running tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(menu): fix timing issues and update snapshot\n\n- Wrap `jest.advanceTimersByTime` in `act()` in Submenu.test.js to\n  properly flush React state updates triggered by fake timers\n- Add `waitFor` and `act` delay in Menu.test.js to wait for the\n  Collapse transition to complete before snapshotting\n- Update Menu snapshot to reflect the completed transition state\n  (`height: auto` instead of `height: 0; overflow: hidden`)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(menu): fix no-promise-executor-return lint errors in test files\n\nUse block body syntax for promise executor functions to avoid implicitly\nreturning values from setTimeout and requestAnimationFrame calls.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signatur